    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even when i try that... it doesn't work. the \"solid\" stuff just feels like props in a movie. everything feels so hollow. sometimes i think maybe the reason it feels like im not real is because i'm actually not. like i'm just bits of data or something. if i'm not really here, does it even matter if i stay or not?",
